{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-07_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-07","title":"只是從天而降！","storyCode":"6-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"29045b1da68b4fe07f8594fe96224753eecb47c542be49cc6d67591379869537","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（前）\n9：00 A.M. 天氣/陰\n近衛局大樓天台攻防戰14小時之前\n切爾諾伯格分城“14區”廢墟上空300米處，“壞傢伙”號\n任務目標：與羅德島救援小隊合流，營救偵察小組\n人員配置：\n“壞傢伙”號及其飛行員；羅德島精英幹員-煌，及其小隊成員\n共一十四人。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aircraft"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經到了，阿米婭她們就在這個位置附近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"把小隊放在城外，真的好嗎？我們現在只有兩個人，你下去你只有一個人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，讓他們阻截整合運動的追兵，順便清理下場地，比讓他們在這打仗要有意義得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"行。地形不太好，我只能送你到這兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少讓我給你放條掛索下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，你什麼時候見我用過掛索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"又要亂來？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？怎麼了？亂來啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"每次和你出任務......你幹的那些事，我光是坐在駕駛座看著都覺得心驚肉跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知不覺中也快習慣了，可這也改變不了你次次亂來的事實啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這說明我和我的小隊，和你是有默契的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哪敢和你有什麼默契！上回你們把人家的聚落拆了，蓄水池填了，還順帶著炸掉了礦場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你腦袋裡裝著的那些胡思亂想，請通通留在地面上，別帶上我的寶貝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"行行行，知道了知道了，“壞傢伙”號，哈？取名時候能不能用點心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你給我下去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人估計發現我們了。煌，就送你到這了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我在廢城出口等你們。動作快點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，有聯絡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......我聽得到！聲音別那麼大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，羅德島頻道的幹員，你好！我是近衛局的，已經在廢城出口處和你們的小隊會合了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局不是撤離了嗎？現在又是演什麼戲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我和另外那個姓陳的可不一樣！相信我，我是來幫你們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"請問貴姓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"免貴，叫代號吧，詩懷雅長官好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那不就是姓？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，你來處理下，我不知道怎麼對付官員......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......煌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不會啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"回來！別跳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才不是叫我下去嗎？交給你了！相信你！（飛吻）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飛行員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"飛吻個鬼啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......她還好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，已經沒有大礙，只是體溫還有點低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"從來......就都很低。我沒事了，讓我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"霜葉......別急。你現在的體溫，和平常比還是低了一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，請幫我拿一下繃帶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"說了，我很好。隕星的傷才更重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"不要緊。怎麼說我也是個薩卡茲人，我還是更擔心你一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，雪怪小隊的動向呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"正，正在向我們的位置靠近！還有五百米左右！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"排障作業還沒完成嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還要至少十五分鐘！這裡倒塌的建築，結構比較複雜，我們不敢直接進行爆破作業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......隕星，做好戰鬥準備。我們要再維持一會兒防線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。你們帶弩彈儲備了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有的，讓後勤幹員給你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭在不在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是有誰的通訊頻道是一直開著的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這可是精英幹員專用頻道，我是能從我這邊直接打開的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"這個聲音是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"完了。居然派了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"請問......是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是啊，這是哪個幹員，怎麼這麼激情？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"她真能改善現在的局勢嗎？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"一個叫煌的，能把身邊所有東西全拆掉，還讓所有人都流一身汗的幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，是我！最後一個評價不太對啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"別......別插科打諢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，你在哪，我們需要你的支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"在你們頭上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"還有兩百米左右。就要到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"射程不夠，沒法攻擊那台機器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"能在空中移動的機器......這也是他們的設備？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"確保他們沒法下降。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"在羅德島的援兵到達前，消滅掉這支羅德島小隊。不能讓他們合流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"等下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"———往後站！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"她又跳下來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"她又跳下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，如果你想，我可以帶你一起跳一次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的話，我不要。你的小隊呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"留在城外了，一會兒就由他們來接應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"風聲很大，把通訊器關了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"各位......我們支援一下煌吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，一會兒無論她說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......都點頭就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"掉下來的這是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"別因為只有一個人就放鬆警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我感受到熱量。她一直在用類似加溫的法術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動的各位，你們好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想和感染者為敵。但聽說各位傷害了我的羅德島同僚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"而且還在追擊我的隊友。現在我要打斷各位一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......多嘴多舌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，你好，用冰的小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我想試試用我的溫度和你的溫度打一次。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["霜星"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["隕星"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["潔西卡"]}]}
